  "albedo": "face-{f}.png lossless RGB 1024² (test and QA master), a1024-{f}.webp q90, a256-{f}.webp (lanczos3) q90; GL cube-face order +X −X +Y −Y +Z −Z, row 0 = t = −1",
  "ssg": "ssg512-{f}.png RGB8 → texture RG8 (B unused). R = round(255·clamp(0.5 − h/(2·0.0016), 0, 1)): sea ⇔ R > 127; shore = 1 − smoothstep(0.5, 1, R/255) = smoothstep(−0.0016, 0, h). G = glow (BAKE_HINT_FS alpha): the prototype export where nothing was removed, the bit-exact CPU port over the island-free albedo where it was.",
  "sel": "sel-*.png RGB8 → texture RG16F. R channel half bits = (R << 8) | G: signed outline distance, geography px of arc (0.46875°), + inside, clamped ±25.9. G channel = B / 128: |∇distance| (geography px per geography px of arc; SEL_GLSL selFw rate = G·(|dFdx d| + |dFdy d|)·0.635/h for an isotropic pixel)."
 },
